OL,4,CIndian man sentenced to 19-plus years  
OL,5,Cin plot to assassinate US-based Sikh   
OL,6,Cseparatist leader                      
OL,7,GA federal judge sentenced an Indian    
OL,8,Gman to 235 months, more than 19 years, 
OL,9,Gin an attempted plot to kill a leading 
OL,10,GSikh political figure in the US.       
OL,12,FNikhil Gupta, an Indian national,      
OL,13,Fpleaded guilty to murder-for-hire,     
OL,14,Fconspiracy to commit murder-for-hire,  
OL,15,Fand conspiracy to commit money         
OL,16,Flaundering in February. On Friday, the 
OL,17,Fjudge said he likely will be deported  
OL,18,For removed after his sentence.         
